From: DuskyProjects <actions@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: gl-be9300: enable the flat IPQ5332 USB controller

The IPQ5332 kernel patch gives the controller a single flat node handled
by the current dwc3-qcom glue driver. Enable that node on the Flint 3.
The driver performs the verified TCSR USB mux selection before reset.

---
 target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq5332-gl-be9300.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq5332-gl-be9300.dts
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq5332-gl-be9300.dts
@@ -486,7 +486,7 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
-&usb_dwc {
+&usb {
 	status = "okay";
 };
